# Normalize line endings: LF in the repository, native in the working tree.
#
# Without this, a CRLF working tree on Windows makes untouched files show as
# modified against an LF index, which hides real changes in a diff. Editing
# marketplace.json from Windows on 2026-09-05 reported the whole file as
# rewritten when a single version string had changed.
* text=auto

# Shell scripts must keep LF even when checked out on Windows, or the shebang
# line carries a CR and the interpreter is not found.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Leave binaries alone - never translate them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
